  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Without a heart to pump blood, it is harder to make a heartless bleed. At 3rd level, the heartless halves all bleed damage they recieve, rounded down, to a minimum of 0 damage.</p>\n<p>At 9th level, the heartless becomes immune to bleed damage.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/heartless#toc11\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
